{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"lawyerly-chondrite-cowbird","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe src/rebar/grounding cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/grounding/deps.py:1-38` — Preserve confirm-only package-existence semantics and closed abstain reasons. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/grounding/detectors/builtin/security_iac_public_exposure.yaml:1-21` — Preserve detector routing, advisory posture, external tfsec/Checkov citations, and false-positive exclusions. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/grounding/detectors/builtin/security_secrets_gitleaks.yaml:1-12` — Preserve sentinel meaning, SARIF backend, and fail-open scanner/fail-closed review composition in fewer words. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/grounding/detectors/builtin/smell_conflict_markers.yaml:1-25` — Preserve file-scoped matching and delimiter false-positive rationale. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/grounding/engine_b.py:1-30` — Preserve backend responsibilities, normalized evidence, and fail-open execution. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/grounding/oracle.py:1-37, 57-73` — Preserve the three public query surfaces and canonical dimensions. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/grounding/resolve.py:1-37` — Preserve confirm-only T1 resolution, index reuse, and fail-open outcomes. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"7da2-4784-1379-42b8","parent_id":"d6eb-1c6c-88c3-48f6","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in src/rebar/grounding"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788570810326479304,"uuid":"0b33dafa-f34e-4fd0-8710-1b4709850818"}